  "details": "Smooth locomotion makes me feel motion sick in VRChat. Holoport is more comfortable for me because my viewpoint stays still while my avatar moves. I’d like to use it when playing without controllers.\n\nI use a Meta Quest 3S connected to PC VRChat through Steam Link. In build 1953, turning on finger-tracking locomotion turns Holoport off. Turning Holoport back on disables movement with the thumb-and-middle-finger pinch.\n\nPlease let me use the existing left-hand pinch gesture with Holoport enabled. I’d like to pinch my thumb and middle finger together, move my hand to guide my avatar while my viewpoint stays still, and release the pinch to move my viewpoint to my avatar’s position.",
